# WASM engine build artifacts — built in CI (wasm job) from pinned tacklebox.
# See "Updating the WASM Engine" in README for local rebuild.
# A rebuilt .wasm differs in almost every byte, so git cannot delta-compress
# it: each committed revision cost ~12 MB of history (#152). Ignore any .wasm
# under app/ so a renamed or relocated build cannot slip in either.
app/**/*.wasm
app/public/wasm_exec.js
